{"sha": "c96009ce53bae0f67b263b06a48c8ceeb329c315ad277b58a810f41c844555ea", "body": ["\\begin{method}[留数的计算]\\label{met:b3:residues:compute}", "单极点：$\\operatorname{Res}(f, a) = \\lim_{z\\to a}(z -", "a)f(z)$；若 $f = g/h$ 且 $g(a) \\neq 0$，$h(a) = 0$，$h'(a)", "\\neq 0$，则 $\\operatorname{Res} = g(a)/h'(a)$。", "$m$ 阶极点：$\\operatorname{Res}(f, a) = \\frac1{(m-1)!}\\lim_{z\\to", "a}\\bigl((z-a)^mf(z)\\bigr)^{(m-1)}$。本性奇点：", "展开并读出 $c_{-1}$（例如由已知级数得到）。始终需", "验证围道实际围住了哪些极点，以及", "各自的环绕数。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}[四类经典积分]", "\\label{ex:b3:residues:integrals}", "(a) \\emph{$\\R$ 上的有理函数}：对于 $\\int_\\R\\frac{\\dd x}{1 +", "x^4}$，取上半平面内的大半圆周 $S_R$ 作围道，", "其上被积函数为 $O(R^{-4})$，故", "$\\int_{S_R} \\to 0$（ML），由留数定理及", "极点 $\\eu^{\\iu\\pi/4}, \\eu^{3\\iu\\pi/4}$（均为单极点，留数", "为 $\\frac1{4z^3} = \\frac{z}{4z^4} = -\\frac z4$ 在极点处），于是得", "\\[", "\\int_\\R\\frac{\\dd x}{1 + x^4}", "= 2\\iu\\pi\\Bigl(-\\frac{\\eu^{\\iu\\pi/4}}4 -", "\\frac{\\eu^{3\\iu\\pi/4}}4\\Bigr)", "= \\frac{\\pi}{\\sqrt2} .", "\\]", "(b) \\emph{傅里叶型}：对 $t \\geq 0$，", "$\\int_\\R\\frac{\\eu^{\\iu tx}}{1 + x^2}\\dd x =", "2\\iu\\pi\\operatorname{Res}\\bigl(\\tfrac{\\eu^{\\iu tz}}{1+z^2},", "\\iu\\bigr) = 2\\iu\\pi\\frac{\\eu^{-t}}{2\\iu} = \\pi\\eu^{-t}$ ---", "取上半圆周可行，因为在其上 $\\abs{\\eu^{\\iu tz}} =", "\\eu^{-t\\operatorname{Im}z} \\leq 1$；取实部得：", "$\\int_\\R\\frac{\\cos(tx)}{1+x^2}\\dd x = \\pi\\eu^{-\\abs t}$，", "由此证实\\cref{exo:b3:lebesgue:10}中在本阶段不加证明地承认的公式。", "(c) \\emph{周期上的三角积分}：作代换 $z =", "\\eu^{\\iu t}$, $\\cos t = \\frac{z + z^{-1}}2$, $\\dd t =", "\\frac{\\dd z}{\\iu z}$: $\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\frac{\\dd t}{a + \\cos t}$", "（$a > 1$）时，该积分化为单位圆内的留数计算", "（\\cref{exo:b3:residues:2}）。", "(d) \\emph{级数}：将 $f$ 与 $\\pi\\cot(\\pi z)$ 配对，其极点", "为整数，留数均为 $1$：周末问题借此", "求和 $\\sum n^{-2}$ 与 $\\sum n^{-4}$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.15]", "  \\draw[->] (-2.5,0) -- (2.6,0) node[right, font=\\small]", "    {$\\operatorname{Re}$};", "  \\draw[->] (0,-0.5) -- (0,2.5) node[above, font=\\small]", "    {$\\operatorname{Im}$};", "  \\draw[omThm, very thick, ->] (-2,0) -- (0.3,0);", "  \\draw[omThm, very thick] (0.3,0) -- (2,0);", "  \\draw[omThm, very thick] (2,0) arc (0:90:2);", "  \\draw[omThm, very thick, ->] (2,0) arc (0:50:2);", "  \\draw[omThm, very thick] (0,2) arc (90:180:2);", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\small] at (1.75,1.55) {$S_R$};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (2.2,-0.25) {$R$};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (-2.15,-0.25) {$-R$};", "  \\fill[omDef] (45:1.19) circle (1.6pt)", "    node[above right, font=\\small] {$\\eu^{\\iu\\pi/4}$};", "  \\fill[omDef] (135:1.19) circle (1.6pt)", "    node[above left, font=\\small] {$\\eu^{3\\iu\\pi/4}$};", "  \\fill[black!40] (-45:1.19) circle (1.6pt);", "  \\fill[black!40] (-135:1.19) circle (1.6pt);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 用于 $\\int_\\R\\frac{\\dd x}{1 +", "x^4}$ 的半圆围道：当 $R \\to \\infty$ 时，圆弧贡献 $O(R^{-3})$，", "留数定理计入被围住的两个极点（蓝色）。", "下方两个极点（灰色）位于围道之外，指标为 $0$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{辐角原理与儒歇定理}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[辐角原理]", "\\label{thm:b3:residues:argument}", "设 $f$ 为 $\\Omega$ 上的亚纯函数，零点为 $z_j$（阶数为", "$m_j$），极点为 $p_k$（阶数为 $\\mu_k$），又 $\\gamma$ 为闭", "路径，位于 $\\Omega$ 内且避开所有这些点，并满足", "$\\operatorname{Ind}_\\gamma = 0$ 于 $\\Omega$ 之外，则", "\\index{辐角原理}", "\\[", "\\frac1{2\\iu\\pi}\\int_\\gamma\\frac{f'(z)}{f(z)}\\,\\dd z", "= \\sum_j m_j\\operatorname{Ind}_\\gamma(z_j)", "- \\sum_k \\mu_k\\operatorname{Ind}_\\gamma(p_k)", "\\]", "（仅有限多项非零）。对于简单的正向", "闭路，该积分计算内部零点个数减去", "极点个数（计重数） --- 且等于", "像路径 $f\\circ\\gamma$ 绕 $0$ 的环绕数。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "在 $m$ 阶零点附近：$f = (z-a)^mg$，$g(a) \\neq 0$，因此", "$\\frac{f'}f = \\frac m{z - a} + \\frac{g'}g$，其中第二项", "在 $a$ 附近全纯，故为留数是 $m$ 的单极点。在", "$\\mu$ 阶极点附近：$f = (z-a)^{-\\mu}g$，留数为", "$-\\mu$。其余处 $\\frac{f'}f$ 全纯。（指标非零的零点与", "极点位于被", "$\\gamma$ 所围的紧区域内；由恒等定理，它们在其中只有有限个，", "因 $f \\not\\equiv 0$）。应用", "\\cref{thm:b3:residues:residue}。最后一点：", "$\\frac1{2\\iu\\pi}\\int_\\gamma\\frac{f'}f =", "\\frac1{2\\iu\\pi}\\int_{f\\circ\\gamma}\\frac{\\dd w}w =", "\\operatorname{Ind}_{f\\circ\\gamma}(0)$（作代换 $w =", "f(\\gamma(t))$）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[儒歇]\\label{thm:b3:residues:rouche}", "设 $f, g$ 为 $\\Omega$ 上的全纯函数，$\\gamma$ 为闭", "路径，满足 $\\operatorname{Ind}_\\gamma \\in \\{0,1\\}$，且在", "$\\Omega$ 之外为零（即简单闭路）。若\\index{儒歇定理}", "\\[", "\\abs{g(z)} < \\abs{f(z)} \\qquad \\text{在 }", "\\operatorname{im}\\gamma,", "\\]", "则 $f$ 与 $f + g$ 在", "区域 $\\{\\operatorname{Ind}_\\gamma =", "1\\}$ 内的零点个数（计重数）相同。", "\\end{theorem}", ""]}